                                                             Optimistic and pessimistic locking concept are provided by JPA and implemention done by Hibernate.

1️⃣ Optimistic Locking kya hota hai?
👉 Optimistic ka matlab = Assume karo conflict nahi hoga :
                             - Database me lock nahi lagata.
                             - Sirf update ke time check karta hai ki data kisi aur ne change to nahi kiya
                             - Mostly Version column use karta hai.
                             - Ex-> User A aur User B same record read kar rahe hain :
                                                                     User A read version = 1
                                                                     User B read version = 1

                                                                   User A update → version becomes 2
                                                                   User B update → FAIL (because version mismatch),Error: OptimisticLockException

2️⃣ Pessimistic Locking kya hota hai?
👉 Pessimistic ka matlab = Assume karo conflict zarur hoga :
                             - Database me actual lock laga deta hai
                             - Dusra user tab tak wait karega.
                             - Ex-> User A record read kare:
                                                          SELECT * FROM user FOR UPDATE;
                                               ➡️ Ab User B update nahi kar sakta (wait karega)

Note:- ye Concurrency Problem ko resolve krte hai Jab multiple users same data update karein. like,
                                                                                                  Lost Update
                                                                                                  Dirty Read
                                                                                                  Inconsistent Data
